---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tattoo Artists by State & City
permalink: /cities/
description: Browse the best tattoo artists by state and city across all 50 states. Pick your state, drill down to your city, and find your artist by style.
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-inner">
    <p class="page-kicker">Browse by Location</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Tattoo artists by <span style="color:var(--gold-bright)">state &amp; city</span></h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">All 50 states. Pick yours below, or use the <a href="/map/">interactive map</a> to drill straight down to cities and artists.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="state-index">
    {%- for st in collections.stateHubs %}
    <a class="state-index-item {{ 'has-artists' if st.reviewCount else 'is-empty' }}" href="/cities/{{ st.slug }}/">
      <span class="state-index-name">{{ st.name }}</span>
      <span class="state-index-meta">
        {%- if st.reviewCount -%}
          {{ st.reviewCount }} artist{{ "s" if st.reviewCount != 1 }} · {{ st.cities.length }} {{ "cities" if st.cities.length != 1 else "city" }}
        {%- else -%}
          Coming soon
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="prose hub-copy">
    <h2>Find the best tattoo artist in your city</h2>
    <p>
      We're building the definitive directory of the single best tattoo artist in every city in
      America — reviewed, not just listed, and tagged by the styles each artist actually
      specializes in. Pick your state above to see the cities we cover there, then drill down to the
      artists. Rather start from the work you want? Browse the <a href="/style/">style index</a> to
      find your artist by style — blackwork, fine-line, realism, traditional, psychedelic, patriotic
      and more.
    </p>
    <p>
      States with reviewed artists are marked; the rest are filling in fast. If your city's crown is
      still open and you know who deserves it, <a href="/get-reviewed/">put them on the map.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/contact-band.njk" %}
